<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Tracked Octave Fuzz" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A saw synth plays an octave above whatever you play and is squashed, together with the guitar, through a germanium fuzz into a tweed 4x10. Like an octave fuzz, but the upper octave is tracked, so it holds on chords and never glitches. The fuzz turns the two into one ringing, raspy voice." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
